{"4815270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KRUSHPIT", "steam_appid": 4815270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4978830], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE MEATGRINDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KRUSHPIT is an intense roguelike survival game where you fight through endless hordes of mutants right in the middle of rusty garages and grim concrete panels. Wipe out everything in your path, grab the loot, and stay alive as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815270/extras/e962a7b6828569b9519255039813645a.poster.avif?t=1787399121\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815270/extras/e962a7b6828569b9519255039813645a.webm?t=1787399121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815270/extras/e962a7b6828569b9519255039813645a.mp4?t=1787399121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE &amp; BECOME OP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemies to gather XP and level up! Every upgrade drops with a random rarity—from Common to Mythic—making every run unique. Combine weapons, artifacts, and innate character passives to break the game and become truly OP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815270/extras/c8a5b4082353867e166787cb07d1fe67.poster.avif?t=1787399121\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815270/extras/c8a5b4082353867e166787cb07d1fe67.webm?t=1787399121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815270/extras/c8a5b4082353867e166787cb07d1fe67.mp4?t=1787399121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPIN THE SLOTS, TAKE THE RISK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got some spare cash from your run? Find a Slot Machine on the map and test your luck! Spin the reels to hit the jackpot, get free level-ups, or earn rare currency. Risk it all to scale your power faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815270/extras/afb2d711f6017433b8b9b290a3090cf3.poster.avif?t=1787399121\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815270/extras/afb2d711f6017433b8b9b290a3090cf3.webm?t=1787399121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815270/extras/afb2d711f6017433b8b9b290a3090cf3.mp4?t=1787399121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REAL-TIME PVP LADDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of smashing mobs? Jump into the competitive PvP mode and face off against real players! Prove your skills, outlive your opponent, and steal their MMR. Climb the global leaderboard and show everyone who the real boss of KRUSHPIT is!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE MEATGRINDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KRUSHPIT is an intense roguelike survival game where you fight through endless hordes of mutants right in the middle of rusty garages and grim concrete panels. Wipe out everything in your path, grab the loot, and stay alive as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 